tain separate open issues after customer-reported resolution. Never claim field repair verified. Table order is not OEM diagnostic order. Missing source dependencies block generation and cannot be solved by rider questions. Distinguish SUPPORTED/AMBIGUOUS/UNSUPPORTED/SAFETY_STOP/SYSTEM_ERROR under TRDv0.4. Explicit OEM service stops dominate additional checks. Support wording: Kindly write to Royal Enfield at support@royalenfield.com.\r\n\r\nRevision provenance: owner-requested origin declaration added; previous frozen content preserved. This provenance does not imply approval.\r\n"
