          "fillable": false,
          "row_header": false,
          "row_section": false,
          "row_span": 1,
          "start_col_offset_idx": 1,
          "start_row_offset_idx": 1,
          "text": " Do not release the brake lever / pedal when pulsations are felt during hard application of the brakes in an emergency situation. The pulsations only indicate that the ABS is activated.  Do not apply only the front or rear brake as it can lead to inefficient braking."
