      "exact_text": "Royal Enfield Himalayan\n43\nOPERATION OF CONTROLS\n\nThe options can be navigated by joystick up and down\npress and selected by joystick center press.\n\nAny two of the above options will be shown in the ana-\nlog screen.\n\nPress the home button on the LH switch cube to go\nback.\niii. Digital content\n\nCenter press the joystick with the digital content\noption selected to explore the options.\n\nThe following options are available.\n\nTrip distance\n\nAverage fuel consumption\n\nTrip time\n\nAverage speed\n\nMax speed\n\nThe options can be navigated by joystick up and down\npress and selected by joystick center press.\n\nAny four of the above options will be shown in the digi-\ntal screen.\n\nPress the home button on the LH switch cube to go\nback.\n1831km\nkm\n1\n2\n0\n1831km\nkm\n1\n2\n0\nTrip Distance\nAvg.Fuel Cons.\nAnalogue Content\nTrip Time\nAvg. Speed\nAnalogue Content\n1831km\nkm/\n1\n2\n0\nAvg. Speed\nMax Speed\nAnalogue Content\n",
