      "exact_text": "Royal Enfield Himalayan\n112\nMINOR MAINTENANCE TIPS\n\nLoosen and remove the air filter cover Allen screw 3\nNos by using 4 mm Allen key available in the tool kit.\n\nTake out the cover from air filter box.\n\nPull out filter element and check for dust, dirt and oil\nparticles inside air filter box clean carefully.\nNOTE\nUsage of high pressure compressed air is not recom-\nmended to clean air filter element. Fitment of air filter ele-\nment is in the reverse order of removal process.\n",
