      "exact_text": "Royal Enfield Himalayan\n39\nOPERATION OF CONTROLS\nii.  Background\n\nCenter press the joystick with the background option\nselected to change the background theme of the\ninstrument cluster.\n\nThere are two options available: Auto and dark theme.\n\nThe options shall be navigated by joystick up & down\npress and selected by joystick center press.\n\nPress the home button on the LH switch cube to go\nback.\nNOTE\nDefault it is in auto theme (day time - light theme & night\ntime - dark theme).\nThe dark theme shall be applicable to both Analog and\nDigital screen type.\n1831km\nkm\n1\n2\n0\n1831km\nkm\n1\n2\n0\nODO\nTrip 1\nGolden line\nGolden line\n1831km\nkm\n1\n2\n0\n1831km\nkm\n1\n2\n0\nGolden line\nOutside Temp\nGolden line\nTrip 2\nTrip 1\nOutside temp\nTrip 2\n1831km\nkm/h\n1\n2\n0\nAUTO\nDark Theme\nBackground\n",
