      "exact_text": "Royal Enfield Himalayan\n32\nOPERATION OF CONTROLS\nSIDE PANEL LEFT                                                                                                                           \n\nTo access the left side panel loosen and remove the\nAllen bolt by using 4 mm Allen key available in the tool\nkit.\nSIDE PANEL RIGHT                                                                                                        \n\nTo access the right side panel loosen and remove the\nAllen bolt by using 4 mm Allen key available in the tool\nkit.\nPILLION AND RIDER SEAT DISMANTLING                     \n\nInsert the key on the pillion seat key slot and turn\nclockwise direction.\n",
