      "exact_text": "Royal Enfield Himalayan\n36\nOPERATION OF CONTROLS\n\nExample: If 2 segments are filled completely battery\nvoltage is 12.5 V, if upto 3 segments half filled it\ndenotes as 13 V.\n\nLikewise we have four segments in temperature gauge\nas shown and each segments carries 15°C.\n\nExample: If 2 segments are filled completely gauge\ndenotes as 90°C, if upto 3 segments half filled it\ndenotes as 98°C (approximately).\nFor Digital Screen\nNOTE\n\nFuel consumption will only be shown when the vehicle\nis under operation, and the fuel range value will be\nupdated while the vehicle is driven condition.\n\nThe displayed fuel consumption and range values are\nestimates, and the actual values may vary from those\nshown.\nDistance to empty\n\nDistance to empty is a features which shows how\nmuch distance the vehicle can run while in reserve\ntank/low fuel indicator starts glowing.\n12:00 | 22\nTrip 1\n0.0\nkm\n--.-\n0\n4:08\nkm/l\nkm/h\nh:mm\nAvg\nAvg\n12:00 | 22\nTrip 2\n0.0\nkm\n4:08\nkm/l\nkm/h\nh:mm\n12:00 | 22\nFuel Range\n146\nkm\n12:00 | 22\nFuel Consumption\n--.-\nkm/l\n--.-\n0\nAvg\nAvg\n12:00 | 22\nVoltage\n10.5V\n14.5V\n12:00 | 22\nService Due In\n476\nkm\n44\ndays\n12:00 | 22\nEngine Temperature\n---\n60°C\n120°C\n",
