      "evidence_id": "policy_0bf7c40741c9e3355e8d2737",
      "exact_text": "Apply the routing policy in order. A known safety stop retains its verified warning and skips model work; a known system failure remains SYSTEM_ERROR; a known unsupported request abstains. Missing, stale or unapproved source/dependency review enters source review or abstention. Unconfirmed applicability enters one focused clarification; a confirmed mismatch blocks the action. An approved missing dependency triggers one exact-ID fetch and bounded retrieval expansion. Complete eligible evidence with uncertain ordering triggers one cross-encoder attempt; otherwise continue through the remaining gates.",
